        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Jalapeno Bread Recipe</title>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  body {\n    font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #f5e6d3;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 1024px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #f2e2c9, #eeddc0);\n    position: relative;\n    padding-bottom: 20px;\n    border-bottom: 6px solid black;\n  }\n  .header-bar {\n    background: black;\n    height: 78px;\n    position: relative;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .header-bar h1 {\n    color: white;\n    font-size: 34px;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding-left: 330px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n  }\n  .ribbon {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 10px;\n    left: 0;\n    background: linear-gradient(to right, #f7c9a0, #f2b98d);\n    padding: 12px 40px 12px 20px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    color: black;\n    clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 90% 50%, 100% 100%, 0 100%);\n    z-index: 5;\n  }\n  .content {\n    display: flex;\n    padding: 25px 20px 20px 20px;\n    gap: 25px;\n  }\n  .table-container {\n    flex: 0 0 645px;\n  }\n  table {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    background: white;\n  }\n  th {\n    background: black;\n    color: white;\n    text-align: left;\n    padding: 10px 12px;\n    font-size: 18px;\n  }\n  th.qty-col {\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  td {\n    border: 1px solid #444;\n    padding: 8px 12px;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n  td.qty {\n    text-align: center;\n    border-left: 1px solid #444;\n  }\n  .directions {\n    flex: 1;\n    padding-top: 5px;\n  }\n  .directions h2 {\n    text-align: center;\n    text-decoration: underline;\n    font-size: 26px;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n  }\n  .directions p {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    margin: 0 0 14px 0;\n    line-height: 1.35;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"header-bar\">\n    <div class=\"ribbon\">1 lb. Loaf</div>\n    <h1>Jalapeno Bread</h1>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"content\">\n    <div class=\"table-container\">\n      <table>\n        <colgroup>\n          <col style=\"width: 53%;\">\n          <col style=\"width: 47%;\">\n        </colgroup>\n        <tr>\n          <th>Ingredients</th>\n          <th class=\"qty-col\">1 lb.</th>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>Water (80&deg;F &ndash; 90&deg;F)</td>\n          <td class=\"qty\">&frac12; cup</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>Oil</td>\n          <td class=\"qty\">1 &frac12; tbsp.</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>Canned Whole Kernel Corn, well drained</td>\n          <td class=\"qty\">&frac12; cup</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>Jalapeno Peppers, well drained</td>\n          <td class=\"qty\">2 TBL</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>Sugar</td>\n          <td class=\"qty\">&frac34; tsp.</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>Salt</td>\n          <td class=\"qty\">&frac14; tsp.</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>Bread Four</td>\n          <td class=\"qty\">2 cups</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>Bread Machine Yeast</td>\n          <td class=\"qty\">&frac34; tsp.</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>Corn Meal</td>\n          <td class=\"qty\">&frac13; cup</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>Fresh Cilantro, chopped</td>\n          <td class=\"qty\">2 tsp.</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>Active Dry Yeast</td>\n          <td class=\"qty\">1 &frac34;  tsp.</td>\n        </tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"directions\">\n      <h2>DIRECTIONS</h2>\n      <p>&bull; Place ingredients in the pan of the bread machine in the order the ingredients are listed.</p>\n      <p>&bull; Insert bread pan securely into baking chamber; close lid. Plug unit into wall outlet.</p>\n      <p>&bull; Select white bread cycle, crust color, and the correct  loaf size; press Start.</p>\n      <p>&bull; When the bread is finished and all cycles are complete, remove the pan from the chamber (using potholders).</p>\n      <p>&bull; Remove the bread from the pan and allow to cool (at least 20 minutes).</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
